    "text": "Let the six numbers&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>.If the mean of these six numbers is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and their variance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
