  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and common difference be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p>Given mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>17</mn></math>.</p><p>Now variance is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>121</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>196</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>289</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>699</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>361</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>105</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math></p>"
